      "writtenOn": "2026-07-02T21:39:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems time-consuming. Don\u0027t you think it is sufficient to run ./docker-run-sanity.sh for the version specified by the tested configuration? If not, why not test compilation in the same way?",
